        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Angelspit, Blood on the Dance Floor, Lords of Acid\n- Albums: Hideous and Perfect\n- Places: United States, Orlando, Florida\n- Topics: tours, music releases\n\nFacts:\n- Blood on the Dance Floor is an American electronic music duo from Orlando, Florida, that was formed in 2006.\n- In March 2011, Angelspit performed with Lords of Acid on a 22-date tour in the United States.\n- In October 2011, Angelspit toured the United States with Blood on the Dance Floor.\n- Hideous and Perfect is the third studio album by the Australian electro-industrial band Angelspit.",
